                        <field name="dc_title">The Hon. Pedro Cevallos, first Secretary of State and the Office, has informed the Council through the Hon. Mr. Duke of Infantado, its President, dated 5 of this month the Royal Order that reads like this: Hon. Mr: With date 3 of the current has been served the King to issue the following Royal Decree: "Not having been my Real spirit altering in any way by my decree of January 26 last the Special Commission or Court created by me in this Court to understand the causes of State; and well satisfied of the righteousness, zeal and activity of the Judges that compose it, I want it to continue in its tasks until the end of the pending cases and their incidences... [Text printed] </field>
